// EXPECT_STDOUT drained-200-lines
//
// Item 20 (canopus `output_over_4k`): a test binary whose stdout lines come
// to more than 4096 bytes used to BLOCK (`nova test src` did not read the
// child's piped stdout; TIMEOUT ~70s) -- the product had to keep every
// test unit's output under 4096 bytes. The runner now drains the child's
// stdout concurrently: 201 lines (~9 KB) run to completion and the
// the final line matches. Evidence the ORACLE-WORKAROUND(20) note
// (src/acp/README.md "Two units, short test names") is removable against
// this release.
module spec_tests.conformance.standalone.output_over_4k_drain

